      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The fear of their judgment is a very real and painful thing, but remember that their perception of you is not the objective truth of your worth. You are not defined by a financial failure, and you don't owe anyone a performance of success. If the constant pressure of their gaze feels unbearable, perhaps you can find a quiet, private space where you don't have to face that scrutiny. Sometimes the most immediate relief comes from stepping away from the audience entirely.",
